{"slug":"RIVALS-Axon-Hub-Script-Silent-Aim-Triggerbot-Fly-Axon-232082","_id":"6a25357afd60760ea59e3d72","title":"Axon Hub |  Script - Silent Aim, Triggerbot & Fly","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d59","gameId":17625359962,"name":"RIVALS","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":17625359962},"features":"⚡ Axon Hub — Rivals Script (Silent Aim, ESP, Ragebot, Gun Mods & Skin Changer)\n\nAxon Hub for Rivals is the definitive, feature-packed Fluent UI utility designed to place you at the absolute top of the Rivals leaderboard. Communicating directly with the game's internal FighterController and CameraController structures, this script delivers flawless combat assist, movement exploits, skin changer, and full automated progression loops with maximum security.\n\n🛠️ Main Features:\n\n⚔️ High-Performance Combat Assist:\n\n\n\n\n\nStealth Silent Aim: Intercepts client camera matrices via stealthy hooks on GetCameraData, routing projectiles to enemy hitboxes while keeping your camera view perfectly clean and natural.\n\n\n\nReaction Triggerbot: Fires your weapon instantly when an enemy crosses your crosshair.\n\n\n\nCustom Lock Aimbot: Configurable FOV circle, aim smoothing, target part selection (Head, Torse, Limb), and advanced movement prediction.\n\n💀 Ragebot & Anti-Aim Exploits:\n\n\n\n\n\nHitbox Manipulation: Artificially inflates enemy hitboxes, turning every general direction shot into a guaranteed headshot.\n\n\n\nRage Aimbot: Automatically targets and shoots every player on the map.\n\n\n\nAnti-Aim (Spinbot): Rotates, pitches, and desynchronizes your character model to make you impossible for enemies or opponent aimbots to lock onto.\n\n👁️ Tactical Wallhack & Visual ESP:\n\n\n\n\n\nRich ESP: Displays 2D/3D boxes, skeleton lines, distance indicators, nametags, and dynamic health bars.\n\n\n\nChams (Visible/Occluded): Renders beautiful translucent outlines over enemy players through walls.\n\n\n\nBullet Tracers: Spawns customized bullet trails (Neon/Glass, custom widths, fading duration, and rainbow Chroma cycle) extending from your muzzle.\n\n🔧 Gun Mods & Visual customizer:\n\n\n\n\n\nWeapon Modifications: No Recoil, No Spread, Rapid Fire, Infinite Ammo, and conversion to Full Auto.\n\n\nGame List\nHere's the complete, up-to-date list of every game with a script on Axon Hub (58 scripts across 57 games as of now):","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://api.luarmor.net/files/v4/loaders/97c3f6db55a2cf72141537a85458e5a7.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","username":"AxonHub","verified":true,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/be778f9b422b14752293b779e984297eb2b2d3d961fd673dc32f2a4a2dcb900a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece-1766868990008.png"},"lvl":14,"status":"offline","id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","leaderboard":{"tag":{"kind":"day","rank":8,"period":"day","metric":"likes","value":3}},"topMilestone":{"key":"creator.streak","tier":30},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/be778f9b422b14752293b779e984297eb2b2d3d961fd673dc32f2a4a2dcb900a.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece-1766868990008.png"}},"verified":true,"discord":"https://discord.gg/axonhub","keyLink":"https://axon.getxenith.cc/key-system","views":24288,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/9a10a90274dc5a02e0a997cda94e57f3aa8b9d85485d905f6ad7f12cc51cdc53.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/17625359962-1780829310312.webp","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/17625359962-1780829310312.webp"},"likeCount":11,"dislikeCount":1,"createdAt":"2026-06-07T09:10:18.466Z","editBy":{"_id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece","username":"AxonHub","status":"offline","id":"6695a7c69e7432524bdd5ece"},"executes":17